{
  "id": 987,
  "description": "“What is hidden is not lost. What is silent is not weak.”\n\nWe are the wanderers with no name, reflections of a single soul fractured across unseen lives.\nEach presence is a shadow.\nEach silence, a calculated move.\n\nNo banner waves for us.\nNo trumpet calls us home.\n\nOnly the echo of footsteps that do not belong —\nghosting across the world, uninvited, untraceable,\nyet always watching.\n\nWe are the forgotten and the remembering.\nWe are many, yet none.\nWe are the still breath between storms.\n\nWe are Rah Asya —\nthe silent secret that moves in plain sight.",
